{"id":"2401933431e79141","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-finite-model-property.md","title":"Finite Model Property","display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-finite-model-property","aliases":["93-df-finite-model-property"],"display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","depends_on":["[[93-df-validity]]","[[93-df-finite-model]]","[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-first-order-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-finite-model-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-finite-model-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2aa3cbc444df6275\" href=\"?note=2aa3cbc444df6275\" title=\"93-df-validity\">93-df-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e8c89671eb83702\" href=\"?note=9e8c89671eb83702\" title=\"93-df-finite-model\">93-df-finite-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a first-order language and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}\\)</span> is the first-order-language predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}\\)</span> is the validity predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2aa3cbc444df6275\" href=\"?note=2aa3cbc444df6275\" title=\"93-df-validity\">93-df-validity</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}\\)</span> is the finite-set predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the first-order formula set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K:\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K:\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reverse implication of validity is automatic from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\subseteq\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\subseteq\\mathcal K\\)</span>. The displayed direction is the substantive finite-countermodel condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-validity","status":"resolved","id":"2aa3cbc444df6275","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-finite-model","status":"resolved","id":"9e8c89671eb83702","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"cc9bc888c7dda430","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}$ is the first-order-language predicate of [[93-df-first-order-language]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-validity","status":"resolved","id":"2aa3cbc444df6275","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}$ is the validity predicate of [[93-df-validity]], and $\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}$ is defined here.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ is the finite-set predicate of [[93-df-set-theoretic-background]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}model\\text{-}property}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FMP}_{93}(\\mathcal K;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\{\\mathfrak A:\\mathrm{FOStruct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\{\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathcal K:\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}(|\\mathfrak A|)\\},\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\n\\to\\mathrm{Valid}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\subseteq\\mathcal K","display":false}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"0838691d607f25ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-model-property]]"}],"outgoing":["2aa3cbc444df6275","9e8c89671eb83702","e30eac382dc7d1a7","cc9bc888c7dda430"]}